  "label": "Misogyny",
  "description": "The meme implicitly references misogyny by objectifying the Swedish women as desirable and idealized, while simultaneously devaluing Muslim women (who are not shown but implied to be inferior). This is a form of gender-based prejudice that reduces women to their physical appearance and sexual desirability, reinforcing harmful stereotypes that women are only valuable if they are attractive or 'Western.' The meme uses this to contrast the 'ideal' woman with the 'inferior' Muslim woman, promoting a hierarchy of gendered worth.",
